<title>USA: Utah $25 mln housing bonds yield 6.35 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Utah $25 mln housing bonds yield 6.35 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
